{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "dts-identity-auto-test",
    "name": "DTS Identity Service - Auto Test",
    "description": "# DTS Identity Service - Postman Collection\n\n## Huong dan su dung\n\n1. Import file nay vao Postman\n2. Import file `DTS_Identity_Environment.json` vao Postman Environments\n3. Chon environment **DTS Identity - Local**\n4. Chay **Collection Runner** theo thu tu: Authentication -> User Management -> Admin\n\n## Tu dong hoa\n- Token tu dong duoc lay khi chay Login va gan vao bien `accessToken`\n- `refreshToken` tu dong duoc luu\n- Sau khi tao user/role/permission, ID tu dong duoc luu vao bien environment de dung cho cac request tiep theo\n- Khong can nhap thu cong bat ky token hay ID nao",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// ============================================================",
          "// COLLECTION PRE-REQUEST: Auto login neu chua co token",
          "// Dam bao moi request deu co Bearer token hop le",
          "// ============================================================",
          "var token = pm.environment.get('accessToken');",
          "var isLoginRequest = pm.request.url.toString().includes('/auth/login');",
          "",
          "if (!token || token === '' || token === 'undefined') {",
          "    if (isLoginRequest) return; // tranh loop khi dang login",
          "    console.log('[AUTO-LOGIN] Token chua co, dang tu dong login...');",
          "    var baseUrl = pm.environment.get('baseUrl') || 'http://103.75.182.249:8081';",
          "    var username = pm.environment.get('adminUsername') || 'testuser2';",
          "    var password = pm.environment.get('adminPassword') || 'Test@1234';",
          "",
          "    pm.sendRequest({",
          "        url: baseUrl + '/api/v1/auth/login',",
          "        method: 'POST',",
          "        header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },",
          "        body: {",
          "            mode: 'raw',",
          "            raw: JSON.stringify({ username: username, password: password })",
          "        }",
          "    }, function(err, res) {",
          "        if (err) {",
          "            console.error('[AUTO-LOGIN] Error:', err);",
          "        } else {",
          "            var json = res.json();",
          "            if (json.success && json.data && json.data.accessToken) {",
          "                pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
          "                pm.environment.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
          "                pm.environment.set('adminUserId', json.data.user.id);",
          "                console.log('[AUTO-LOGIN] Token saved! User:', json.data.user.username);",
          "            } else {",
          "                console.error('[AUTO-LOGIN] Login failed:', json.message);",
          "            }",
          "        }",
          "    });",
          "} else {",
          "    console.log('[TOKEN] Token da co san, skip auto-login.');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    },

    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Response time < 3000ms', function() {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(3000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
